sequenceDiagram
    participant VM as ViewModel (Ch 6)
    participant Op as StreamCopier (Dispatchers.IO, Ch 1)
    participant Src as Source (file/URI)
    participant Dst as Dest (app-specific/SAF, Ch 62)

    VM->>Op: copy(src, dst) off-main
    loop per bounded chunk
        Op->>Src: read(buffer)  // constant memory
        Op->>Op: ensureActive (cancellation)
        Op->>Dst: write(buffer) [hash/compress/encrypt streamed]
        Op-->>VM: emit progress (bytes/total)
    end
    Op->>Dst: close + rename temp -> final (atomic)
    Op-->>VM: done (hash)
